/// M05 CORE-032 "bundled numbers: roots green".
/// Source: tests/integration/numbers_test.go symbol
/// TestCurrentBundledNumbers.
/// Related fixtures: std/scalars/current/src/main.can (ground for every
/// per-function pin below: format_int 1, format_float 4, format_bool 2,
/// int_float 2, float_int 3, bool_int 2, int_bool 3, floor_value 2,
/// ceil_value 1, trunc_value 1, round_value 2, finite_value 2, nan_value 2,
/// parse_int 3, parse_float 5, parse_bool 2, referenced_format 1,
/// fixture_format 1, main 1 = 40 roots) and runtime/test/number.test.ts
/// (the staged bun trace pinned by trace-pass/trace-fail).
/// Disposition: RETAIN (migrate row; the old Go harness stays until the
/// integrator retires it after every linked row, variant, environment and
/// control has accepted evidence).
/// Protects (this file): canlc assert green with passed report and exactly
/// 40 roots grounded per function in main.can, plus the staged bun trace
/// counts.
/// Number semantics live in core-032-numbers-semantics.can; the run
/// output/status shape and silent production entry live in
/// core-032-run-shape.can.
/// Variants: main fixture (the only loop row); bigint, NaN/infinity, exact
/// represented values and invalid parses are pinned as counts and verbatim
/// text in the semantics slice.
/// Environment: CAN_BUN_ARCHIVE + macOS sandbox-exec; requires
/// can-bun-archive, macos-sandbox-exec. Logical gates SUITE/DIAG/FAULT and
/// C/R/N/S/A identities bind at P23; no live run now.
/// Delegated oracles: DELEGATE-013 (runtime/test/number.test.ts,
/// read-only record; 6 declarations; not executed here).
/// Execution credit: NOT claimed (accept_after P23 unmet).
/// Case bundled/numbers-roots checks: assert-green, report-passed,
/// root-count, fixture-name, format-int-roots, format-float-roots,
/// format-bool-roots, int-float-roots, float-int-roots, bool-int-roots,
/// int-bool-roots, floor-roots, ceil-roots, trunc-roots, round-roots,
/// finite-roots, nan-roots, parse-int-roots, parse-float-roots,
/// parse-bool-roots, referenced-format-roots, fixture-format-roots,
/// main-roots, trace-pass, trace-fail.
/// Facet map (numbers_test.go legs): assert-green pins the assert leg
/// (L80-82: exit 0, empty stderr); report-passed/root-count pin the report
/// leg (L85: passed true, 40 assertions for main); fixture-name grounds
/// the 40 roots in main.can (L74: {"main", 40}; L75-79: main.can staged);
/// format-int-roots pins format_int (main.can L9: large => ok digits);
/// format-float-roots pins format_float (L16-19: -0 => "0", NaN, Infinity,
/// -Infinity); format-bool-roots pins format_bool (L26-27: true/false);
/// int-float-roots pins int_float (L34-35: exact 2^53 => ok, 2^53+1 =>
/// inexact); float-int-roots pins float_int (L44-46: exact, negative_zero,
/// fraction); bool-int-roots pins bool_int (L55-56: true => 1, false => 0);
/// int-bool-roots pins int_bool (L63-65: 1/0/invalid); floor-roots pins
/// floor_value (L74-75: negative, infinity); ceil-roots pins ceil_value
/// (L82: negative); trunc-roots pins trunc_value (L89: negative);
/// round-roots pins round_value (L96-97: negative, tie); finite-roots pins
/// finite_value (L104-105: finite, infinity); nan-roots pins nan_value
/// (L112-113: nan, finite); parse-int-roots pins parse_int (L120-122:
/// large, space, zero); parse-float-roots pins parse_float (L131-135:
/// exponent, underflow, leading_zero_float, leading_zero_integer,
/// overflow); parse-bool-roots pins parse_bool (L144-145: yes, invalid);
/// referenced-format-roots pins referenced_format (L154: sample);
/// fixture-format-roots pins fixture_format (L159: sample); main-roots pins
/// main (L169: unit); trace-pass/trace-fail pin the staged bun trace (L32:
/// "6 pass", "0 fail").
/// Shared old files untouched; retirement is a later integrator decision.
